SUMMARY:[DESIGN] Onboarding + pair on DASH-1 kickoff
DESCRIPTION:Read ONBOARDING.md end to end. Set NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL to https
 ://api-dev.healthclouda.com/api/v1 (shared dev backend\, synthetic data - 
 experiment freely).\n\nConfirm the three verification commands pass on a c
 lean clone:\n  npx tsc --noEmit   -> no output\n  npm test           -> 63
  passed\n  npm run build      -> green\n\nIf they don't pass\, that is NOT
  you being new - say so and we fix it together.\n\nThen pair with @Bastoh 
 on the DASH-1 kickoff: read design_handoff_dashboards/README.md\, open the
  Superadmin .dc.html beside npm run dev\, and agree the component boundari
 es before writing code.\n\nDefault owner: @Qeeyat (design lane). Lane labe
 ls are ownership DEFAULTS\, not walls - either dev may take any item\, but
  claim its In Flight row in HANDOFF.md before cutting the branch.\n\nPlan:
  docs/FRONTEND_SPRINT_PLAN.md
CATEGORIES:DESIGN
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
