UID:20260811-infra-a3-cookie-scoping-a4-fail-loud-config-b3-env-var-contrac
 t@healthclouda.com
DTSTAMP:20260810T120000Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260811
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260812
SUMMARY:[INFRA] A3 cookie scoping\, A4 fail-loud config\, B3 env var contra
 ct
DESCRIPTION:A3 (SECURITY): do NOT set COOKIE_DOMAIN=.healthclouda.com. A do
 t-prefixed parent domain shares cookies across EVERY subdomain\, so a dev-
 tier session cookie would be sent to the beta and production frontends. Ho
 st-only cookies (the current default) keep the tiers isolated. The var is 
 documented in .env.example but never read in code - delete the documentati
 on rather than leave a loaded footgun.\n\nA4: config.ts:16 falls back to h
 ttp://localhost:8000/api/v1 when NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is unset. In a deploy
 ed build that fails silently and confusingly. Throw at build time outside 
 development.\n\nB3: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL + NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL\, scoped pe
 r Vercel environment and branch.\n\nDefault owner: @Bastoh (infra lane). L
 ane labels are ownership DEFAULTS\, not walls - either dev may take any it
 em\, but claim its In Flight row in HANDOFF.md before cutting the branch.\
 n\nPlan: docs/FRONTEND_SPRINT_PLAN.md
CATEGORIES:INFRA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
