 px blur\, slide-in 0.28s. Modal 420px centred\, 52px icon chip. Toast bott
 om-right\, 2.6s. EmptyState 44px stroke icon - EVERY list has one.\n\nSmal
 lScreenGate: below 768px\, staff/admin dashboards render ONLY a branded 'n
 eeds a bigger screen' notice. Applies to DASH-1..5.\n\nCRITICAL: DASH-6 Pa
 tient must NOT get this gate - it is the only mobile-responsive dashboard.
  Patients use phones. Easy to get backwards\; the screenshot harness catch
 es it.\n\nDefault owner: @Qeeyat (design lane). Lane labels are ownership 
 DEFAULTS\, not walls - either dev may take any item\, but claim its In Fli
 ght row in HANDOFF.md before cutting the branch.\n\nPlan: docs/FRONTEND_SP
 RINT_PLAN.md
