BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260819-design-dash-4-receptionist-registration-hcl-id-portal-invite-c
 heck@healthclouda.com
DTSTAMP:20260810T120000Z
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260819
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260820
SUMMARY:[DESIGN] DASH-4 Receptionist - registration\, HCL-ID\, portal invit
 e\, check-ins
DESCRIPTION:THE DENSEST PHI-FACING PR. Everything a front desk does on day 
 one.\n\nRegistration: email OPTIONAL\, phone REQUIRED when email is omitte
 d. The form must allow submitting without an email. Surface the returned H
 CL-ID clearly - the receptionist reads it out to the patient.\n\nAlso surf
 ace\, at the front desk: an email-less patient has NO portal login and CAN
 NOT approve cross-org access. That's a real-world consequence a receptioni
 st needs to understand at the counter\, not a footnote.\n\nPortal invite s
 hows when has_portal_account is false AND an email exists. Error copy for 
 the 409 (email belongs to another account) has to be comprehensible to a n
 on-technical user.\n\nDefault owner: @Qeeyat (design lane). Lane labels ar
 e ownership DEFAULTS\, not walls - either dev may take any item\, but clai
 m its In Flight row in HANDOFF.md before cutting the branch.\n\nPlan: docs
 /FRONTEND_SPRINT_PLAN.md
CATEGORIES:DESIGN
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
